{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-absorption-emission","title":"原子吸收与发射光谱（Atomic Absorption & Emission Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/atomic-absorption-emission","wordCount":2680,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"原子吸收与发射光谱-atomic-absorption-emission-spectroscopy\">原子吸收与发射光谱（Atomic Absorption &amp; Emission Spectroscopy）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AAS 与 AES 基于同一物理事实的两面：<strong>原子外层电子在不同能级间跃迁时会吸收或发射特定波长的光</strong>。区别只在于&quot;看哪一端&quot;——AAS 观察基态原子<strong>吸收</strong>了多少光，AES 观察激发态原子<strong>发射</strong>了多少光。因此两者的光源、定量关系和适用场景完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;原子光谱 电子能级跃迁&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;AAS 基态原子吸收特征光&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;AES 激发态原子发射特征光&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;光源 HCL 单元素锐线&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;原子化 火焰 石墨炉 氢化物 冷蒸气&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[&quot;A = k·l·N 单元素逐一测&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;激发源 火焰 电弧 火花 ICP&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;I = A_ki·hν·N* 多元素同时测&quot;]&#10;    B3 --&gt; G[&quot;Boltzmann 分布决定 N*/N0&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[\"原子光谱 电子能级跃迁\"] --&gt; B[\"AAS 基态原子吸收特征光\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"AES 激发态原子发射特征光\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"光源 HCL 单元素锐线\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"原子化 火焰 石墨炉 氢化物 冷蒸气\"]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[\"A = k·l·N 单元素逐一测\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"激发源 火焰 电弧 火花 ICP\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[\"I = A_ki·hν·N* 多元素同时测\"]\n    B3 --&gt; G[\"Boltzmann 分布决定 N*/N0\"]\n    C2 --&gt; G</pre><p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原子化是两种技术的共同核心步骤</strong>：把元素从化合物状态变为自由气态原子。原子化方式（火焰、石墨炉、氢化物发生、冷蒸气、ICP）决定灵敏度、干扰水平和可测元素范围。</li>\n<li><strong>AAS 需要&quot;锐线光源&quot;</strong>：空心阴极灯发射线宽（~0.002 nm）远小于吸收线宽（~0.005 nm），这是 AAS 高选择性、低干扰的根源；代价是每种元素需一支灯，只能单元素逐一测定。</li>\n<li><strong>AES 的强度由 Boltzmann 分布决定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∝</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^*/N_0 \\propto \\exp(-E^*/k_B T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，激发温度越高、激发态布居越多、发射越强——这解释了为何 8000 K 的 ICP 灵敏度远超 2300 K 的火焰。</li>\n<li><strong>检测限的量级差异</strong>：火焰 AAS ~ppb；石墨炉 AAS（GFAAS）~ppt；ICP-OES ~ppb（轴向 sub-ppb）；ICP-MS 更低。选择时按所需检测限逐级上移。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误解</strong>：认为&quot;发射一定比吸收灵敏&quot;。实则火焰 AES 因温度低只适合易激发的碱金属；对难原子化、难激发元素（如 Al、难熔金属），GFAAS 常比 ICP-OES 更灵敏，因为它们比拼的是各自的原子化与测量条件，而非笼统的谱学原理。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡</strong>：AAS 仪器便宜、选择性好，但单元素、通量低；ICP-OES 多元素、动态范围宽，但成本高、对谱线重叠敏感。单元素痕量选 AAS，多元素常规选 ICP-OES，超痕量或需同位素信息选 ICP-MS。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"原子光谱分析基础\">原子光谱分析基础</h2><p>原子光谱分析利用原子外层电子在不同能级之间跃迁时吸收或发射特征波长光辐射的现象来进行元素的定性和定量分析。每种元素的原子具有独特的电子能级结构，因此其吸收/发射光谱线的波长是该元素的&quot;指纹&quot;。这一原理可追溯到 1860 年 Kirchhoff 和 Bunsen 发现的太阳光谱暗线与元素的对应关系。</p>\n<p>原子跃迁遵循选择定则，共振线（从基态到第一激发态的跃迁）通常最强，是分析中最常用的特征线。例如：Na 的共振线为 589.0/589.6 nm（D 线双峰），Cu 为 324.75 nm，Pb 为 217.0 nm。</p>\n<p>原子光谱分析的基本流程：样品引入 → 原子化（将样品中的元素从化合物状态转变为自由气态原子）→ 光谱测量 → 定量分析。原子化方式是区分各种原子光谱技术的关键因素。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原子吸收光谱法-aas\">原子吸收光谱法（AAS）</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>原子吸收光谱法（Atomic Absorption Spectrometry, AAS）基于基态自由原子对特征辐射的共振吸收。当从空心阴极灯（HCL）发出的待测元素的锐线光通过含有该元素自由原子的原子化器时，基态原子吸收其特征波长的光辐射，透射光强度减弱。吸光度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与原子浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系遵循 Beer-Lambert 定律的原子光谱形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\log\\frac{I_0}{I} = k(\\nu) \\cdot l \\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(\\nu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 处的吸收系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 为吸收光程长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为基态原子数密度。在实际分析中，吸光度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与待测元素浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 在一定范围内呈线性关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = a + b \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"光源-空心阴极灯\">光源——空心阴极灯</h3><p>空心阴极灯（Hollow Cathode Lamp, HCL）是 AAS 最常用的锐线光源。灯的阴极为圆筒形，由待测元素的金属或合金制成。灯管充入低压惰性气体（Ne 或 Ar），当施加数百伏电压时，气体放电产生正离子轰击阴极表面，溅射出阴极元素原子。这些原子在放电空间被激发后发出该元素的特征谱线。HCL 发射线宽度极窄（~0.002 nm），远小于原子化器中吸收线的宽度（~0.005 nm），满足&quot;锐线光源&quot;条件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"火焰原子化器\">火焰原子化器</h3><p>火焰原子化是最常用的原子化方式。液体样品经雾化器产生气溶胶，与燃气/助燃气混合后进入火焰。常用火焰类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>火焰类型</th>\n<th>温度</th>\n<th>适用元素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空气-乙炔</td>\n<td>~2300°C</td>\n<td>大多数金属（Cu, Zn, Pb, Cd, Fe...）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氧化亚氮-乙炔</td>\n<td>~2900°C</td>\n<td>难原子化元素（Al, Ti, V, Mo, Si...）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在火焰中，样品经历：雾化 → 蒸发脱溶剂 → 熔融/蒸发 → 解离为自由原子 → （部分电离）的过程。火焰 AAS 的典型检测限为 1-100 μg/L（ppb 级），线性范围约 2-3 个数量级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"石墨炉原子化器-gfaas-etaas\">石墨炉原子化器（GFAAS / ETAAS）</h3><p>石墨炉原子化（Graphite Furnace AAS, GFAAS；或电热原子化 ETAAS）使用石墨管作为原子化器，通过程序升温（干燥 → 灰化 → 原子化 → 净化）将样品原子化。石墨管由大电流（~400 A）加热，原子化温度可达 2800°C。</p>\n<p>GFAAS 相比火焰 AAS 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>灵敏度高 100-1000 倍（检测限 0.01-1 μg/L，低 ppb 至 ppt 级）</li>\n<li>样品用量少（10-50 μL）</li>\n<li>可分析固体样品（浆液进样）</li>\n<li>可使用基体改进剂减少干扰</li>\n</ul>\n<p>但 GFAAS 分析速度慢（每个样品 2-3 分钟，含升温程序），且一次只能测定一种元素。</p>\n<h3 id=\"氢化物发生-原子吸收-hg-aas\">氢化物发生-原子吸收（HG-AAS）</h3><p>砷（As）、硒（Se）、锑（Sb）、锡（Sn）、铋（Bi）、锗（Ge）等元素可与还原剂 NaBH₄ 反应生成气态氢化物：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">As^{3+} + NaBH_4 + HCl \\rightarrow AsH_3 \\uparrow + \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>气态氢化物被导入加热的石英管中分解为自由原子进行 AAS 测定。这一方法将待测元素从复杂基质中分离出来，消除了基质干扰，同时实现了富集，As 的检测限可达 0.1 μg/L。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冷蒸气法测汞-cv-aas\">冷蒸气法测汞（CV-AAS）</h3><p>汞是唯一在室温下呈气态的金属元素。样品中 Hg²⁺ 被 SnCl₂ 或 NaBH₄ 还原为 Hg⁰：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>↑</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Hg^{2+} + Sn^{2+} \\rightarrow Hg^0 \\uparrow + Sn^{4+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>产生的 Hg⁰ 蒸气被载气送入吸收池（长光程石英池），直接测量 253.7 nm 处吸光度。金汞齐预富集技术可将检测限降低到 ng/L 级别（sub-ppb）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原子发射光谱法-aes-oes\">原子发射光谱法（AES / OES）</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>原子发射光谱法（Atomic Emission Spectrometry, AES；或 Optical Emission Spectrometry, OES）测量激发态原子回到低能级时发射的特征光辐射强度。发射强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 与激发态原子数密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = A_{ki} \\cdot h\\nu \\cdot N^* \\cdot l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{ki}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为自发发射爱因斯坦系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 为光子能量。在热力学平衡条件下，激发态布居数由 Boltzmann 分布决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>E</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N^*}{N_0} = \\frac{g^*}{g_0} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{E^*}{k_B T}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2017em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3657em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3657em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3657em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因此发射强度随激发温度升高而增大。这解释了为什么 ICP（~8000 K）的发射灵敏度远高于火焰（~2300 K）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"火焰光度法\">火焰光度法</h3><p>火焰光度法是最简单的 AES 形式，使用空气-丙烷或空气-乙炔火焰作为激发源。由于火焰温度较低，仅适用于容易激发的碱金属和碱土金属（Na, K, Li, Ca）。火焰光度法至今仍是临床实验室测定血清电解质（Na⁺, K⁺）的备选方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电弧-火花发射光谱\">电弧/火花发射光谱</h3><p>直流电弧（~5000-7000 K）和交流火花（~10,000-40,000 K）是固体样品直接分析的激发源。电弧光谱灵敏度高但精密度差；火花光谱精密度好但灵敏度稍低。火花光发射光谱仪（Spark-OES）是冶金工业中金属材料快速成分分析的标准工具——将金属样品作为一个电极，在氩气氛围中放电激发，数十秒内同时测定数十种合金元素。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电感耦合等离子体发射光谱-icp-oes\">电感耦合等离子体发射光谱（ICP-OES）</h3><p>ICP-OES（也称 ICP-AES）使用电感耦合等离子体（6000-10000 K）作为原子化和激发源，是目前最重要的多元素同时分析技术之一。ICP 的详细原理将在本章第三篇&quot;ICP-MS 与 ICP-OES&quot;中深入讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aas-与-aes-的比较\">AAS 与 AES 的比较</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>AAS</th>\n<th>AES (ICP-OES)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测定方式</td>\n<td>单元素逐一测定</td>\n<td>多元素同时测定（&gt;70种）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光源</td>\n<td>空心阴极灯（每种元素一支）</td>\n<td>ICP（通用激发源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测限</td>\n<td>火焰 ~ppb；GFAAS ~ppt</td>\n<td>~ppb（轴向观测可达 sub-ppb）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性范围</td>\n<td>2-3 数量级</td>\n<td>5-6 数量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基质效应</td>\n<td>较大（需基体匹配）</td>\n<td>较小（高温消除大部分化学干扰）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析通量</td>\n<td>低（单元素）</td>\n<td>高（多元素同时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仪器成本</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"环境监测\">环境监测</h3><p>AAS 和 ICP-OES 是环境水体和土壤中重金属检测的标准方法。各国环境标准（如中国 GB 5749 饮用水标准、美国 EPA 方法）对 Pb、Cd、Cr、As、Hg 等有毒元素规定了严格限值。典型方法：GFAAS 测定饮用水中 Pb（检测限 0.1 μg/L，标准限值 10 μg/L）；冷蒸气 AAS 测定水中 Hg（检测限 0.02 μg/L，标准限值 1 μg/L）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"食品安全\">食品安全</h3><p>食品中有毒元素（Pb、Cd、As、Hg、Cr）的限量检测是食品安全监管的核心内容。大米中无机砷、海产品中甲基汞的形态分析需要色谱-原子光谱联用技术（HPLC-ICP-MS 或 HPLC-HG-AFS）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"临床诊断\">临床诊断</h3><p>全血和血清中的微量元素水平反映人体营养和中毒状态。GFAAS 或 ICP-MS 测定血铅（铅中毒筛查）、血清锌/铜（Wilson 病诊断）、全血硒（硒缺乏评估）等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"地质与材料分析\">地质与材料分析</h3><p>矿石品位测定、合金成分控制、半导体材料纯度检验等应用需要高精度元素分析。激光剥蚀（LA）技术可与 ICP-MS/ICP-OES 联用实现固体样品的微区元素分布测定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>原子吸收与发射光谱是最成熟、应用最广的元素分析技术。AAS 以其高选择性、操作简便和低成本在单元素痕量分析中保持重要地位；ICP-OES 以其多元素同时分析能力和宽动态范围成为常规实验室的主力设备。理解原子化过程（火焰、石墨炉、等离子体）的物理化学原理，是优化分析方法、消除干扰、获得可靠结果的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原子吸收与发射光谱（Atomic Absorption & Emission Spectroscopy）","id":"原子吸收与发射光谱-atomic-absorption-emission-spectroscopy"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原子光谱分析基础","id":"原子光谱分析基础"},{"level":2,"text":"原子吸收光谱法（AAS）","id":"原子吸收光谱法-aas"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"光源——空心阴极灯","id":"光源-空心阴极灯"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰原子化器","id":"火焰原子化器"},{"level":3,"text":"石墨炉原子化器（GFAAS / ETAAS）","id":"石墨炉原子化器-gfaas-etaas"},{"level":3,"text":"氢化物发生-原子吸收（HG-AAS）","id":"氢化物发生-原子吸收-hg-aas"},{"level":3,"text":"冷蒸气法测汞（CV-AAS）","id":"冷蒸气法测汞-cv-aas"},{"level":2,"text":"原子发射光谱法（AES / OES）","id":"原子发射光谱法-aes-oes"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰光度法","id":"火焰光度法"},{"level":3,"text":"电弧/火花发射光谱","id":"电弧-火花发射光谱"},{"level":3,"text":"电感耦合等离子体发射光谱（ICP-OES）","id":"电感耦合等离子体发射光谱-icp-oes"},{"level":2,"text":"AAS 与 AES 的比较","id":"aas-与-aes-的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"环境监测","id":"环境监测"},{"level":3,"text":"食品安全","id":"食品安全"},{"level":3,"text":"临床诊断","id":"临床诊断"},{"level":3,"text":"地质与材料分析","id":"地质与材料分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"串联质谱与应用（Tandem MS & Applications）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/mass-spectrometry/tandem-ms-applications"},"next":{"title":"X 射线荧光与光电子能谱（XRF & XPS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/xrf-xps"}}